{"page":148,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:147","surah":6,"ayah":147,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِن كَذَّبُوكَ فَقُل رَّبُّكُمْ ذُو رَحْمَةٍ وَٰسِعَةٍ وَلَا يُرَدُّ بَأْسُهُۥ عَنِ ٱلْقَوْمِ ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If they [the disbelievers] accuse you [Prophet] of lying, say, ‘Your Lord has all-encompassing mercy, but His punishment cannot be diverted from the evildoers.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"6:147"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَذَّبُوكَ","en_gloss":"they deny you","transliteration":"kadhabūka","verse_key":"6:147"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَقُل","en_gloss":"then say","transliteration":"faqul","verse_key":"6:147"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَّبُّكُمْ","en_gloss":"Your Lord","transliteration":"rabbukum","verse_key":"6:147"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ذُو","en_gloss":"(is the) Possessor","transliteration":"dhū","verse_key":"6:147"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَحْمَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"(of) Mercy","transliteration":"raḥmatin","verse_key":"6:147"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٰسِعَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"Vast","transliteration":"wāsiʿatin","verse_key":"6:147"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"but not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"6:147"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُرَدُّ","en_gloss":"will be turned back","transliteration":"yuraddu","verse_key":"6:147"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بَأْسُهُۥ","en_gloss":"His wrath","transliteration":"basuhu","verse_key":"6:147"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"6:147"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-qawmi","verse_key":"6:147"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","en_gloss":"(who are) criminals","transliteration":"l-muj'rimīna","verse_key":"6:147"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٤٧","en_gloss":"(147)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:147"}]},{"verse_key":"6:148","surah":6,"ayah":148,"ar_uthmani":"سَيَقُولُ ٱلَّذِينَ أَشْرَكُوا۟ لَوْ شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ مَآ أَشْرَكْنَا وَلَآ ءَابَآؤُنَا وَلَا حَرَّمْنَا مِن شَىْءٍ ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ كَذَّبَ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ حَتَّىٰ ذَاقُوا۟ بَأْسَنَا ۗ قُلْ هَلْ عِندَكُم مِّنْ عِلْمٍ فَتُخْرِجُوهُ لَنَآ ۖ إِن تَتَّبِعُونَ إِلَّا ٱلظَّنَّ وَإِنْ أَنتُمْ إِلَّا تَخْرُصُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The idolaters will say, ‘If God had willed, we would not have ascribed partners to Him- nor would our fathers- or have declared anything forbidden.’ In the same way, those before them continually denied [the truth] until they tasted Our punishment. Say, ‘Have you any knowledge that you can show us? You follow only supposition and tell only lies.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"سَيَقُولُ","en_gloss":"Will say","transliteration":"sayaqūlu","verse_key":"6:148"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"6:148"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَشْرَكُوا۟","en_gloss":"associate partners (with Allah)","transliteration":"ashrakū","verse_key":"6:148"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"6:148"},{"pos":5,"ar":"شَآءَ","en_gloss":"Had willed","transliteration":"shāa","verse_key":"6:148"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"6:148"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:148"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَشْرَكْنَا","en_gloss":"we (would) have associated partners (with Allah)","transliteration":"ashraknā","verse_key":"6:148"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَآ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"6:148"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ءَابَآؤُنَا","en_gloss":"our forefathers","transliteration":"ābāunā","verse_key":"6:148"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"6:148"},{"pos":12,"ar":"حَرَّمْنَا","en_gloss":"we (would) have forbidden","transliteration":"ḥarramnā","verse_key":"6:148"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"[of]","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"6:148"},{"pos":14,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"anything","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"6:148"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"Likewise","transliteration":"kadhālika","verse_key":"6:148"}